2.15
  1
Authored 200 mm raft slab with 600 mm wide, 450 mm overall deep perimeter beam, four T16 edge bars (two upper/two lower), T10 slab bars at 200 mm each way and continuous nominal 100 mm insulation. The shown lower bars have 75 mm bottom cover and upper bars 52 mm top cover. High-strength under-edge insulation needs project-specific bearing verification.
